  "limits": [
    "Initial native offer selection only. Session-wide switching of live Connections remains unavailable and0088/0089 remain unqualified; no new clause credit is assigned to this increment.",
    "Isolated local macOS arm64 signed native QUIC, EdDSA and ES256. Each signature covers preferred PCMA, latest PCMU after historical PCMA replay, and a PCMU-only accepted source under PCMA policy. No Linux/browser/remote/provider or full Gate6 acceptance claim.",
    "FFmpeg decodes actual duplex G.711, including mixed PCMU/PCMA and continued audio after the explicit501 live-update refusal. This is behavior proof, not the frozen quality/impairment workload.",
    "Preferences are not capabilities or IO grants. They cannot select formats absent from the original peer offer, override current accepted capability, alter the signed intent or narrow the advertised capability catalog. Existing bindings are not automatically reconfigured."
  ]
